title: Route1Croissant
tags: cutscene
---
<<declare $r1_croissant_bag = "">>
<<declare $r1_croissant_socks = "">>
<<declare $r1_croissant_dinner = "">>
// Started by knocking on 3A on Sunday morning, after moving day (see door_3a.yarn).
<<walk Player PlayerTo3A>>
<<face Player right>>
<<wait 2>>
// Behind her door.
{$samantha_name}: ...Who is it?
You: Me. From across the hall.
{$samantha_name}: Do you know what time it is?
<<if $r1_movein_rules == "fair">>
    {$samantha_name}: Hold on. I'm deciding whether I'm home.
    <<wait 2>>
    {$samantha_name}: Fine. I'm home.
<<endif>>
<<open_door Door3A>>
<<show Samantha>>
<<walk Samantha SamanthaOut>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Five past six.
You: You said the bakery opens at six.
{$samantha_name}: I said it opens at six. I didn't say come at six.
{$samantha_name}: But you did. Interesting.
{$samantha_name}: What's in the bag?
-> One croissant. Like you said.
    <<set $r1_croissant_bag to "one">>
    {$samantha_name}: Exactly what I asked for. Nothing more, nothing less.
    {$samantha_name}: Good.
-> Two. One's for me.
    <<set $r1_croissant_bag to "two">>
    {$samantha_name}: Was for you.
    {$samantha_name}: Thank you. I'll have the second one for lunch.
-> They were out. I got pain au chocolat.
    <<set $r1_croissant_bag to "swap">>
    {$samantha_name}: At five past six. They were out.
    {$samantha_name}: You stood at the counter and picked the one you wanted. I'll allow it. Once.
{$samantha_name}: Rent's paid. For today.
<<set $item_bakery_bag to false>>
<<note_done croissant>>
// She looks down at his feet.
{$samantha_name}: Now. I told you I'd ask.
<<if $r1_movein_socks == "refuse">>
    {$samantha_name}: You were very sure about it yesterday. Let's see if you meant it.
<<endif>>
{$samantha_name}: Are you wearing them?
-> Yes.
    <<set $r1_croissant_socks to "yes">>
    {$samantha_name}: Show me.
    You: Here? On the landing?
    {$samantha_name}: You knocked on my door at six in the morning. You don't get to be shy now.
    You: ...
    {$samantha_name}: Blush. Told you they were your size.
-> No. I'm not wearing pink socks.
    <<set $r1_croissant_socks to "no">>
    {$samantha_name}: Blush. And at least you're honest about it.
    {$samantha_name}: I'll ask again tomorrow. And the day after.
-> They're in the wash.
    <<set $r1_croissant_socks to "wash">>
    {$samantha_name}: You've had them for one day.
    You: I wanted them clean.
    {$samantha_name}: You're a bad liar. That's useful to know.
{$samantha_name}: Thursday. Eight o'clock. Dinner at mine.
You: Is that an invitation?
{$samantha_name}: It's a time and a place.
-> I'll be there.
    <<set $r1_croissant_dinner to "yes">>
    {$samantha_name}: I know.
-> Should I bring anything?
    <<set $r1_croissant_dinner to "bring">>
    {$samantha_name}: Wine. Red. I'll text you which one.
    {$samantha_name}: Don't pick it yourself.
-> I might be busy.
    <<set $r1_croissant_dinner to "busy">>
    {$samantha_name}: You moved in yesterday. You don't know anyone else in this city.
    {$samantha_name}: Eight o'clock.
{$samantha_name}: Now go back to bed. You look like you didn't sleep.
{$samantha_name}: And thank you. For breakfast.
// She goes back inside with the bag.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaIn>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<close_door Door3A>>
// He goes home.
<<face Player up>>
<<open_door Door3B>>
<<walk Player PlayerInto3B>>
<<face Player down>>
<<close_door Door3B>>
<<wait 1>>
// Time skip to Thursday evening. He is on the landing outside his own door. When this
// node ends the player walks freely; knocking on 3A starts Route1DinnerDoor (door_3a.yarn).
<<fade_out>>
<<place Player PlayerKnock>>
<<face Player down>>
<<card "Thursday. Eight o'clock.">>
<<fade_in>>
<<if $r1_croissant_dinner == "bring">>
    You: Red wine. The one she texted. Not the one I'd have picked.
<<else>>
    You: Eight o'clock. Dinner at hers.
<<endif>>
===
